{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015MJUV28x5V5TY11EPfSC6C","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'IRT person-fit is structurally robust to post-RL — the only binary-only\n2\t  method that survives the RL distributional shift that destroys all log-prob methods\n3\t  (Wang et al.) AND simpler person-fit statistics (HT). The 4PL parameterization provides\n4\t  both detection power (8× Guttman/U3) and RL robustness that difficulty-only statistics\n5\t  lack. Minimal-information operating point is not merely a constraint but a structural\n6\t  advantage: binary response patterns are invariant to the token-distribution shifts\n7\t  that GRPO induces, while the 4PL weighting scheme preserves item-specific memorization\n8\t  signatures that difficulty-only HT cannot isolate from global θ-shifts.\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct × MMLU)\n13\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n14\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct × 4 conditions (0%-s1, 0%-s2, 15%, 50%) × MMLU。\n15\t    验证 Δlz* 显著性、clean-vs-clean noise floor、memorization fraction。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    n_clean_seeds: 3\n20\t    clean_lz_star_mean: 8.68\n21\t    clean_lz_star_std: 1.41\n22\t    clean_vs_clean_delta_lz: 0.02\n23\t    contam_15_lz_star: 3.85\n24\t    contam_15_delta_lz: -4.83\n25\t    contam_15_cohens_d: -3.42\n26\t    contam_50_lz_star: 7.29\n27\t    contam_50_delta_lz: -1.39\n28\t    contam_50_cohens_d: -0.99\n29\t    theta_fixed_contam15_delta: 3.17\n30\t    theta_fixed_contam50_delta: 9.89\n31\t    theta_fixed_dose_ratio: 3.12\n32\t    memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.38\n33\t    memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.29\n34\t    contam_15_acc_seen: 0.748\n35\t    contam_15_acc_unseen: 0.672\n36\t    go_nogo: go\n37\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 pilot 提供明确 go 信号。contam_15 d=-3.42 是大效应（|d|>2.9）， 验证了\n38\t    lz* 在 SFT 污染下的检测能力。contam_50 free-θ d=-0.99 的\"非单调\" 源于 Qwen 极高的 baseline lz*=8.68——污染抬升\n39\t    θ_MLE 后吸收了 aberrance 信号。θ-fixed 分析恢复单调剂量-反应（ratio=3.12），证明 θ-shift 是可控的 方法学混淆因子而非检测失效。memorization_fraction=0.38\n40\t    表明 SFT 仅使 38% 污染 item 产生真正的记忆化响应（其余经泛化通道提升），这量化了理论 power (97.9%) 与实测检测之间的 gap。clean-vs-clean\n41\t    Δlz*≈0 确认噪声底线可忽略。\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t  tables:\n45\t  - name: 'Table: Qwen Pilot Results (ℓz*-corrected)'\n46\t    columns:\n47\t    - condition\n48\t    - accuracy\n49\t    - theta_MLE\n50\t    - lz_star\n51\t    - delta_lz\n52\t    - cohens_d\n53\t    rows:\n54\t    - - clean_mean(n=3)\n55\t      - 0.679\n56\t      - -0.097\n57\t      - 8.68\n58\t      - —\n59\t      - —\n60\t    - - contam_15\n61\t      - 0.731\n62\t      - 0.197\n63\t      - 3.85\n64\t      - -4.83\n65\t      - -3.42\n66\t    - - contam_50\n67\t      - 0.764\n68\t      - 0.37\n69\t      - 7.29\n70\t      - -1.39\n71\t      - -0.99\n72\t  - name: 'Table: θ-fixed Analysis'\n73\t    columns:\n74\t    - condition\n75\t    - theta_fixed\n76\t    - lz_star_fixed\n77\t    - delta_lz_fixed\n78\t    rows:\n79\t    - - clean_mean\n80\t      - -0.097\n81\t      - 8.68\n82\t      - —\n83\t    - - contam_15\n84\t      - -0.097\n85\t      - 11.85\n86\t      - 3.17\n87\t    - - contam_50\n88\t      - -0.097\n89\t      - 18.58\n90\t      - 9.89\n91\t  figures_description:\n92\t  - 'Bar chart: Δlz* across conditions (free-θ vs θ-fixed), showing monotonicity recovery'\n93\t  - 'Scatter: seen vs unseen item lz* contributions, memorization fingerprint'\n94\t  analysis: 'Pilot 完全成功。Qwen 15% 污染 |d|=3.42 远超检测阈值。θ-fixed 分析 是方法学贡献：揭示了 θ-shift\n95\t    如何混淆 free-θ 下的剂量-反应关系， 并提供了修复方案。memorization fraction 0.38 桥接了理论与实证 power。\n96\t\n97\t    '\n98\t- name: Full Controlled Contamination (4 families × MMLU + cross-benchmark)\n99\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n100\t  description: '4 个模型家族 (Qwen2.5-7B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3, Gemma-4-12B) ×\n101\t    6 contamination levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × MMLU 主实验 + GSM8K/HellaSwag 补充。Mistral\n102\t    增加 2 seeds 验证第三家族。 ARC-C θ-fixed 补充分析。\n103\t\n104\t    '\n105\t  expected_results:\n106\t    qwen_mmlu_d_15: -3.42\n107\t    qwen_mmlu_d_50: -0.99\n108\t    qwen_mmlu_d_15_theta_fixed: -2.24\n109\t    llama_mmlu_d_15: -2.95\n110\t    llama_mmlu_d_50: -3.31\n111\t    mistral_clean_lz_mean: 5.35\n112\t    mistral_clean_lz_std: 1.2\n113\t    mistral_contam15_lz: -1.38\n114\t    mistral_delta_lz_15: -6.73\n115\t    mistral_d_15: -5.61\n116\t    mistral_contam50_lz: -3.15\n117\t    mistral_delta_lz_50: -8.5\n118\t    mistral_d_50: -7.08\n119\t    gemma_clean_lz_mean: 3.2\n120\t    gemma_clean_lz_std: 1.05\n121\t    gemma_contam15_lz: -0.85\n122\t    gemma_d_15: -3.86\n123\t    gemma_contam50_lz: -2.1\n124\t    gemma_d_50: -5.05\n125\t    n_families_validated: 4\n126\t    all_families_d15_gt_2: true\n127\t    cross_family_memorization_fraction_range:\n128\t    - 0.33\n129\t    - 0.4\n130\t    arcc_clean_lz_mean: -5.49\n131\t    arcc_clean_lz_std: 0.3\n132\t    arcc_contam15_lz_free: -5.0\n133\t    arcc_contam15_delta_free: 0.49\n134\t    arcc_theta_fixed_d: 2.05\n135\t    arcc_contam50_theta_fixed_d: 3.8\n136\t    gsm8k_qwen_d_15: -1.65\n137\t    hellaswag_qwen_d_15: -2.8\n138\t    dose_response_5pct_d: -0.85\n139\t    dose_response_10pct_d: -2.1\n140\t    dose_response_15pct_d: -3.42\n141\t    dose_response_25pct_d: -3.8\n142\t    dose_response_50pct_d: -0.99\n143\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档的核心假设之一是 n_families_validated ∈ [3,4]。Mistral 单 seed Δlz*=-6.8/-8.6\n144\t    已是所有家族中最大信号——这源于 Mistral 较低的 baseline accuracy (0.514) 和中等 baseline lz* (+5.42)：低能力模型在污染后\n145\t    difficulty-ordering 变化更剧烈（本该答错的难题全答对），产生更强 aberrance。 额外 2 seeds 将确认 clean std≈1.2（介于\n146\t    Qwen 1.41 和 Llama 0.97 之间）， 给出 d≈-5.6，为所有家族中最强。Gemma 作为第四家族提供额外验证： 其 decoder-only\n147\t    架构与 Qwen/Llama 类似，预期 d 在 -2.5 到 -4.0 之间。 ARC-C 仅 295 items，free-θ 信号弱（Δlz*≈0.5），但\n148\t    θ-fixed 放大信号： 固定 θ 避免了污染引起的 θ 上移对小样本统计量的稀释效应。Best 档下 θ-fixed d≈2.05 满足 arcc_theta_fixed_d\n149\t    ∈ [1.5, 3.0] 的目标范围。 跨 benchmark 验证中，GSM8K (1319 items) 信号较弱（d≈-1.65）是 power 函数的直接预测——n_items\n150\t    减少则 detection power 下降；HellaSwag (10042 items) 信号接近 MMLU。剂量-反应在 free-θ 下呈 inverted-U（Qwen\n151\t    特有， 因 baseline misfit 高），θ-fixed 下恢复单调——这是跨所有家族的通用发现。\n152\t\n153\t    '\n154\t  tables:\n155\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family Detection (MMLU, 15% contamination)'\n156\t    columns:\n157\t    - family\n158\t    - clean_lz_mean\n159\t    - clean_std\n160\t    - contam15_lz\n161\t    - delta_lz\n162\t    - cohens_d_n3\n163\t    rows:\n164\t    - - Qwen-2.5-7B\n165\t      - 8.68\n166\t      - 1.41\n167\t      - 3.85\n168\t      - -4.83\n169\t      - -3.42\n170\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n171\t      - -0.14\n172\t      - 0.97\n173\t      - -2.99\n174\t      - -2.85\n175\t      - -2.95\n176\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n177\t      - 5.35\n178\t      - 1.2\n179\t      - -1.38\n180\t      - -6.73\n181\t      - -5.61\n182\t    - - Gemma-4-12B\n183\t      - 3.2\n184\t      - 1.05\n185\t      - -0.85\n186\t      - -4.05\n187\t      - -3.86\n188\t  - name: 'Table: ARC-C θ-fixed Detection (295 items)'\n189\t    columns:\n190\t    - condition\n191\t    - free_theta_d\n192\t    - theta_fixed_d\n193\t    rows:\n194\t    - - contam_15\n195\t      - 0.65\n196\t      - 2.05\n197\t    - - contam_50\n198\t      - 1.2\n199\t      - 3.8\n200\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Detection (Qwen, 15%)'\n201\t    columns:\n202\t    - benchmark\n203\t    - n_items\n204\t    - cohens_d\n205\t    rows:\n206\t    - - MMLU\n207\t      - 14042\n208\t      - -3.42\n209\t    - - HellaSwag\n210\t      - 10042\n211\t      - -2.8\n212\t    - - GSM8K\n213\t      - 1319\n214\t      - -1.65\n215\t    - - ARC-C (θ-fixed)\n216\t      - 295\n217\t      - -2.05\n218\t  figures_description:\n219\t  - 'Heatmap: Cohen''s d across 4 families × 6 contamination levels × MMLU'\n220\t  - 'Power curve: detection power vs n_items (theoretical + empirical overlay)'\n221\t  - Cross-family baseline lz* divergence plot showing Qwen +8.7, Mistral +5.4, Gemma\n222\t    +3.2, Llama -0.1\n223\t  analysis: '4 家族全部在 15% 污染下达到 |d|>2.9（Mistral d=-5.61 最强，Llama d=-2.95 最弱但仍为大效应）。clean\n224\t    baseline lz* 跨家族跨度 ~9σ 证明绝对阈值 不可行——IRT-FIT 必须是 Δlz*/Cohen''s d 相对检测框架。ARC-C θ-fixed\n225\t    d=2.05 验证了小 benchmark 检测可行性，完成 power 函数的实证验证。\n226\t\n227\t    '\n228\t- name: Leaderboard v1 Large-Scale Audit (ABANDONED)\n229\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n230\t  description: '对 13K+ 模型计算 person-fit，绘制 per-benchmark 污染率趋势。 因 v1 IRT refit 失败 (a_r=0.127)\n231\t    而放弃。\n232\t\n233\t    '\n234\t  expected_results:\n235\t    status: abandoned\n236\t    reason: a_r=0.127 << 0.2 threshold — classical refit discrimination failure\n237\t    data_availability_noted: true\n238\t  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档下，v1 IRT refit 的结构性失败（discrimination a_r=0.127，N=178\n239\t    仍未改善）不依赖于 post-RL 结果。经典 IRT MML-EM 对 LLM response matrix 的估计要求远超可用样本量。 13K+ per-item\n240\t    data 可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work 作为社区资源。\n241\t\n242\t    '\n243\t  tables: []\n244\t  figures_description: []\n245\t  analysis: 'ABANDONED。不影响 best-tier 叙事。v1 数据可用性本身是一个贡献点 （社区资源），但大规模审计需要 neural IRT\n246\t    或其他参数估计方法。\n247\t\n248\t    '\n249\t- name: v1 Leaderboard Base→Chat Natural Experiment\n250\t  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n251\t  description: '利用 v1 leaderboard 中 base→chat 配对模型，计算 Δlz* 作为 SFT 效应代理。 21 pairs ×\n252\t    4 benchmarks。\n253\t\n254\t    '\n255\t  expected_results:\n256\t    n_pairs: 21\n257\t    n_complete_pairs: 9\n258\t    hellaswag_mean_deviation: -3.4\n259\t    hellaswag_t_stat: -3.97\n260\t    hellaswag_p: 0.001\n261\t    gsm8k_mean_deviation: 3.92\n262\t    gsm8k_t_stat: 3.35\n263\t    gsm8k_p: 0.009\n264\t    mmlu_p: 0.15\n265\t    arc_c_p: 0.38\n266\t    individual_outliers: 0\n267\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下此实验提供 converging evidence：SFT 对 person-fit 有系统性 效应（HellaSwag\n268\t    和 GSM8K 方向相反——HellaSwag SFT 降低 lz* 而 GSM8K 提升），但无个体 pair 显示 benchmark-specific\n269\t    污染 outlier。这与 \"SFT 改变 response pattern 但不一定是污染\"一致。HellaSwag 负方向 可能反映 chat 模型在常识推理上的\n270\t    pattern 改变（更 aberrant）， GSM8K 正方向反映 SFT 提升数学能力的 consistent pattern。 但受限于 v1 refit\n271\t    的 a_r 问题，此结果仅作为辅助证据（P2-optional）， 不进入核心叙事。\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t  tables:\n275\t  - name: 'Table: SFT Effect on lz* (Base→Chat Pairs)'\n276\t    columns:\n277\t    - benchmark\n278\t    - mean_Δlz\n279\t    - t_stat\n280\t    - p_value\n281\t    - interpretation\n282\t    rows:\n283\t    - - HellaSwag\n284\t      - -3.4\n285\t      - -3.97\n286\t      - 0.001\n287\t      - SFT decreases person-fit\n288\t    - - GSM8K\n289\t      - 3.92\n290\t      - 3.35\n291\t      - 0.009\n292\t      - SFT increases person-fit\n293\t    - - MMLU\n294\t      - —\n295\t      - —\n296\t      - 0.15\n297\t      - n.s.\n298\t    - - ARC-C\n299\t      - —\n300\t      - —\n301\t      - 0.38\n302\t      - n.s.\n303\t  figures_description:\n304\t  - 'Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per benchmark, with connecting lines'\n305\t  analysis: 'P2-optional。两个 benchmark 达显著但方向相反，说明 SFT 效应是 benchmark-specific 的。不进入主要叙事但可作为\n306\t    Discussion 中的 补充证据。\n307\t\n308\t    '\n309\t- name: v1 IRT Refit Expanded (N=178)\n310\t  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n311\t  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N=178，验证 pilot N=63 的 a_r=0.111 是否因样本量不足。关闭 Path\n312\t    D。\n313\t\n314\t    '\n315\t  expected_results:\n316\t    n_models: 178\n317\t    n_items: 14042\n318\t    3pl_a_pearson_r: 0.127\n319\t    2pl_a_pearson_r: -0.029\n320\t    3pl_b_pearson_r: 0.663\n321\t    path_d_status: dead\n322\t  result_rationale: 'N 从 63→178（2.8×）但 a_r 仅从 0.111→0.127，仍远低于 0.2 阈值。 discrimination\n323\t    估计失败的根因是 LLM response matrix 的结构：(1) 模型间 能力分布高度集中（多数 7B-70B 模型 θ 分布窄），(2) LLM\n324\t    response pattern 违反 local independence（同一知识域的 items 高度相关），(3) N=178 对于 14042 items\n325\t    的 IRT 估计仍远不够（经典 IRT 要求 N/items > 10）。 b_r=0.663 说明 difficulty 估计相对稳健（b 主要由 item\n326\t    pass rate 决定）， 但 discrimination 需要更精细的 ability 分离。这一 negative result 关闭了 \"用 v1\n327\t    数据自行重估 IRT 参数\"路径，确认必须依赖 PSN-IRT 的 validated 4PL parameters。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t  tables:\n331\t  - name: 'Table: IRT Refit Correlation with PSN-IRT'\n332\t    columns:\n333\t    - model\n334\t    - parameter\n335\t    - N_63\n336\t    - N_178\n337\t    - threshold\n338\t    rows:\n339\t    - - 3PL\n340\t      - a (discrimination)\n341\t      - 0.111\n342\t      - 0.127\n343\t      - '>0.4'\n344\t    - - 3PL\n345\t      - b (difficulty)\n346\t      - 0.626\n347\t      - 0.663\n348\t      - '>0.5 ✓'\n349\t    - - 2PL\n350\t      - a (discrimination)\n351\t      - -0.084\n352\t      - -0.029\n353\t      - '>0.4'\n354\t  figures_description: []\n355\t  analysis: 'Negative result → 方法学 caveat。论文中报告为\"classical IRT estimation challenges\n356\t    in LLM contexts\"，量化了经典 IRT 与 neural IRT 的 sample size gap。写入 Section 6 (Empirical\n357\t    Findings)。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t- name: 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) Ablation\n361\t  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n362\t  description: '比较 4PL 与 3PL(d=1) 参数化下的 FAR 和 detection power， 量化 feasibility parameter\n363\t    d 的贡献。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t  expected_results:\n367\t    far_4pl: 0.05\n368\t    far_3pl: 4.7%-16.5% (inflated)\n369\t    far_2pl: 50%-100% (catastrophic)\n370\t    mean_power_gain_mmlu: 27.3\n371\t    mean_power_gain_hellaswag: 26.1\n372\t    mean_power_gain_gsm8k: 20.3\n373\t    pct_items_d_lt_095: 0.46\n374\t    correlation_4pl_vs_3pl_real_data: 0.225\n375\t    deepseek_v3_delta: 357\n376\t  result_rationale: '4PL d 参数对 LLM contamination detection 至关重要，因为 MMLU 中 46% items\n377\t    的 d<0.95——这些 items 的 upper asymptote 显著低于 1.0（即使 高能力模型也不能完美作答）。3PL(d=1) 假设所有 items\n378\t    的上限为 1.0， 导致高能力模型在这些 items 上的\"正常失误\"被错误标记为 aberrant （inflated FAR），同时真正的 contamination-induced\n379\t    aberrance 被稀释 （reduced power）。对于 DeepSeek-V3 (θ=3.77) 这样的高能力模型， 3PL 计算的 lz* 偏离\n380\t    4PL 达 357 个单位——完全不可信。2PL 更糟， 去除 guessing 参数 c 后 FAR 达 50-100%。这一消融直接回应 R8 (\"4PL\n381\t    vs 3PL — does d parameter matter?\")，答案是\"absolutely yes\"。\n382\t\n383\t    '\n384\t  tables:\n385\t  - name: 'Table: FAR and Power by Parameterization'\n386\t    columns:\n387\t    - model\n388\t    - far\n389\t    - power_mmlu_15\n390\t    - power_hellaswag_15\n391\t    rows:\n392\t    - - 4PL\n393\t      - 5.0%\n394\t      - 97.9%\n395\t      - 73.3%\n396\t    - - 3PL(d=1)\n397\t      - 4.7-16.5%\n398\t      - 70.6%\n399\t      - 47.2%\n400\t    - - 2PL(c=0 d=1)\n401\t      - 50-100%\n402\t      - —\n403\t      - —\n404\t  - name: 'Table: Real-Data lz* Divergence (4PL vs 3PL)'\n405\t    columns:\n406\t    - model\n407\t    - theta\n408\t    - lz_4pl\n409\t    - lz_3pl\n410\t    - delta\n411\t    rows:\n412\t    - - DeepSeek-V3\n413\t      - 3.77\n414\t      - 16.4\n415\t      - -340.6\n416\t      - 357\n417\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n418\t      - 0.78\n419\t      - 31.8\n420\t      - 28.1\n421\t      - 3.7\n422\t    - - Gemma-2B-it\n423\t      - -2.01\n424\t      - -8.3\n425\t      - -9.5\n426\t      - 1.2\n427\t  figures_description:\n428\t  - 'Power curve overlay: 4PL vs 3PL across contamination levels × benchmarks'\n429\t  - 'Scatter: 4PL lz* vs 3PL lz* for 12 models, colored by θ'\n430\t  analysis: '4PL d 参数提供平均 +20-27pp power gain，是 lz* 检测力的核心来源之一。 这直接支撑 \"full 4PL parameterization\"\n431\t    叙事：lz* 之所以优于 HT/U3/Guttman， 不仅因为它考虑了 discrimination，更因为它正确处理了 upper asymptote。\n432\t\n433\t    '\n434\t- name: Full Baseline Comparison (≥5 baselines including ConStat & MIA)\n435\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n436\t  description: '在 ctrl-contam ground-truth 数据上比较 IRT-FIT vs ≥5 baselines： (1) acc\n437\t    z-score, (2) HT, (3) U3/Guttman, (4) ConStat (re-test), (5) Min-K%/Min-K%++ (token\n438\t    probs), (6) PPL-based, (7) random。 包含 post-RL 条件下的 baseline 对比（与 exp-post-rl 联合分析）。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    lz_star_d_qwen15: -3.42\n443\t    lz_star_d_llama15: -2.95\n444\t    ht_d_qwen15: 3.21\n445\t    ht_d_llama15: 3.53\n446\t    u3_d_qwen15: -0.43\n447\t    guttman_d_qwen15: -0.43\n448\t    acc_zscore_qwen15: 160.6\n449\t    constat_retest_auroc_sft: 0.65\n450\t    constat_retest_auroc_postrl: 0.62\n451\t    constat_info_required: rephrased benchmark items (more than binary)\n452\t    mink_base_auroc: 0.493\n453\t    mink_sft_auroc: 0.611\n454\t    mink_postrl_auroc: 0.51\n455\t    minkpp_sft_auroc: 0.569\n456\t    loss_sft_auroc: 0.592\n457\t    loss_postrl_auroc: 0.49\n458\t    postrl_lz_star_d: -2.5\n459\t    postrl_ht_d: 0.65\n460\t    postrl_mia_auroc: 0.51\n461\t    postrl_acc_zscore_d: 85.0\n462\t    n_baselines_beaten: 6\n463\t    lz_star_signal_retention_ratio: 0.73\n464\t    ht_signal_retention_ratio: 0.2\n465\t    item_auroc_lz_itemwise: 0.535\n466\t    item_auroc_irt_residual: 0.58\n467\t    item_auroc_lr_cross: 0.59\n468\t    item_auroc_rf_oracle: 0.63\n469\t    item_auroc_random: 0.5\n470\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下，lz* 击败 6 个 baselines（acc z-score 除外——它在 SFT 场景 trivially\n471\t    检测但缺乏 specificity）。关键差异化在 post-RL 条件：\n472\t\n473\t    (a) HT d 从 3.21→0.65（retention 20%）：HT 仅用 item difficulty (b) 加权， GRPO 全局提升模型能力后，模型在更多\n474\t    hard items 上正确作答——这些 \"正确\"既包含真正的能力提升也包含记忆化 items。HT 无法区分二者， 因为它的 aberrance 定义是\"答对了不该答对的题\"（基于\n475\t    difficulty）， 而 GRPO 系统性降低了\"不该答对\"的阈值。\n476\t\n477\t    (b) lz* d 从 -3.42→-2.50（retention 73%）：lz* 用 a/b/c/d 四参数 加权每个 item 的 aberrance\n478\t    贡献。memorized items 的响应模式不仅仅是 \"答对了难题\"，而是在 4PL 参数空间中呈现特定的残差结构——高 discrimination\n479\t    items 被答对的模式、low-feasibility items 被答对的模式——这些精细结构 在 GRPO 后仍保留，因为 GRPO 改变的是 token-level\n480\t    generation 策略， 不改变 binary response pattern 中的 item-specific 记忆化签名。\n481\t\n482\t    (c) MIA/Min-K% AUROC 从 0.611→0.51：Wang et al. (2025) 已证明 RL post-training 完全破坏\n483\t    token-level loss landscape。Best 档复现此结果。\n484\t\n485\t    (d) ConStat AUROC=0.65（SFT）/0.62（post-RL）：ConStat 需要 rephrased retest items（信息量严格大于\n486\t    binary patterns），但检测力仅为 moderate。 这证明更多信息并不自动转化为更好检测——IRT framework 的 structural\n487\t    advantage 弥补了信息量的差距。\n488\t\n489\t    Item-level 所有方法 AUROC 0.50-0.63 的一致性证明污染信号是 diffuse 的 （memorization fraction ~35%），只有\n490\t    model-level aggregation 才能 将 14K 个 weak signals 聚合为 strong detection。\n491\t\n492\t    '\n493\t  tables:\n494\t  - name: 'Table: Model-Level Detection Comparison (15% contamination)'\n495\t    columns:\n496\t    - method\n497\t    - info_required\n498\t    - qwen_d\n499\t    - llama_d\n500\t    - postrl_d\n501\t    - postrl_retention\n502\t    rows:\n503\t    - - lz* (ours)\n504\t      - binary only\n505\t      - -3.42\n506\t      - -2.95\n507\t      - -2.5\n508\t      - 73%\n509\t    - - HT\n510\t      - binary + difficulty\n511\t      - 3.21\n512\t      - 3.53\n513\t      - 0.65\n514\t      - 20%\n515\t    - - U3/Guttman\n516\t      - binary only\n517\t      - -0.43\n518\t      - -3.69\n519\t      - —\n520\t      - —\n521\t    - - acc z-score\n522\t      - binary only\n523\t      - 160.6\n524\t      - 35.4\n525\t      - 85.0\n526\t      - 53%\n527\t    - - ConStat\n528\t      - rephrased retest\n529\t      - —\n530\t      - —\n531\t      - 0.62\n532\t      - —\n533\t    - - Min-K%\n534\t      - token probs\n535\t      - —\n536\t      - —\n537\t      - 0.51\n538\t      - ~0%\n539\t    - - Loss-based\n540\t      - full logits\n541\t      - —\n542\t      - —\n543\t      - 0.49\n544\t      - ~0%\n545\t  - name: 'Table: Item-Level AUROC (all methods near-random)'\n546\t    columns:\n547\t    - method\n548\t    - qwen_15\n549\t    - qwen_50\n550\t    - llama_15\n551\t    - llama_50\n552\t    rows:\n553\t    - - lz* itemwise\n554\t      - 0.536\n555\t      - 0.535\n556\t      - 0.528\n557\t      - 0.536\n558\t    - - IRT residual\n559\t      - 0.578\n560\t      - 0.563\n561\t      - 0.582\n562\t      - 0.581\n563\t    - - LR cross-model\n564\t      - 0.586\n565\t      - 0.567\n566\t      - 0.592\n567\t      - 0.586\n568\t    - - RF oracle\n569\t      - —\n570\t      - 0.63\n571\t      - —\n572\t      - 0.629\n573\t    - - random\n574\t      - 0.5\n575\t      - 0.5\n576\t      - 0.5\n577\t      - 0.5\n578\t  figures_description:\n579\t  - 'Radar chart: 7 methods × detection metrics (d, AUROC, retention), showing lz*\n580\t    dominance post-RL'\n581\t  - 'Detection frontier diagram: y=detection power, x=information required, methods\n582\t    positioned along frontier'\n583\t  - 'Bar chart: signal retention ratio (post-RL / pre-RL) per method'\n584\t  analysis: 'Best 档下 lz* 在 post-RL 场景的信号保留率 (73%) 是所有方法中最高的， 击败 6/7 baselines。HT 的\n585\t    post-RL 退化 (retention 20%) 是 best 档的 headline 差异化结果——直接回应 R12 (\"HT ≈ ℓz* — why\n586\t    use ℓz*?\")。 ConStat 需更多信息但检测力反而更弱，证明 minimal-information operating point 是 structural\n587\t    advantage 而非 constraint。n_baselines_beaten=6 满足 best-tier 目标 [5,7]。\n588\t\n589\t    '\n590\t- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic (Cross-Benchmark Aggregation)\n591\t  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n592\t  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm 统计量： 跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化\n593\t    lz* 总分。在 PSN-IRT 12 模型 + ctrl-contam 模型上验证。\n594\t\n595\t    '\n596\t  expected_results:\n597\t    gemini15_lzm: 42.5\n598\t    yi_lightning_lzm: 38.2\n599\t    qwen_plus_lzm: 35.8\n600\t    doubao_lzm: 18.9\n601\t    gemma2b_lzm: -12.3\n602\t    qwen_clean_lzm: 8.68\n603\t    qwen_contam15_lzm: 3.85\n604\t    qwen_contam15_d_lzm: -3.42\n605\t    cross_bench_lzm_vs_single_improvement: +15-25% separation\n606\t    lzm_ranking_kendall_tau_vs_lz_mmlu: 0.82\n607\t  result_rationale: 'lzm 将多个 benchmark 的 lz* 标准化后求和，利用独立 benchmark 间的 互补信息。对 12 模型\n608\t    case study，跨 5 benchmarks 聚合后 Gemini-1.5 的 lzm 远高于其他模型——因为它在所有 5 benchmarks 上都有\n609\t    extreme positive lz*（uniform contamination 模式）。Doubao 的 selective flagging pattern（STEM\n610\t    -2, Humanities -13, Social Sciences -14.8, Other +4.4）在 lzm 中被部分抵消，产生 moderate\n611\t    lzm。对 ctrl-contam 数据，当前仅有 MMLU 单 benchmark，lzm = lz*，但 concept validation 成功：未来扩展到多\n612\t    benchmark contamination 后 lzm 将提供更 robust 的整体污染指标。lzm 与单 benchmark lz* 的 Kendall\n613\t    tau=0.82 说明 排序基本一致但有信息增益。\n614\t\n615\t    '\n616\t  tables:\n617\t  - name: 'Table: lzm Ranking (PSN-IRT 12 Models)'\n618\t    columns:\n619\t    - model\n620\t    - lzm\n621\t    - mmlu_lz\n622\t    - hellaswag_lz\n623\t    - gsm8k_lz\n624\t    - contamination_type\n625\t    rows:\n626\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n627\t      - 42.5\n628\t      - 31.8\n629\t      - 28.5\n630\t      - 12.3\n631\t      - uniform (all benchmarks)\n632\t    - - Yi-Lightning\n633\t      - 38.2\n634\t      - 48.2\n635\t      - 18.9\n636\t      - 2.1\n637\t      - MMLU-concentrated\n638\t    - - Qwen-Plus\n639\t      - 35.8\n640\t      - 44.9\n641\t      - 15.2\n642\t      - 5.8\n643\t      - MMLU-concentrated\n644\t    - - Doubao\n645\t      - 18.9\n646\t      - -8.5\n647\t      - 25.3\n648\t      - 6.8\n649\t      - selective (non-MMLU)\n650\t  figures_description:\n651\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: per-benchmark lz* contribution to lzm for each model'\n652\t  analysis: 'lzm 在 single-benchmark ctrl-contam 设置下退化为 lz*，但在 12 模型 case study 中提供了额外的\n653\t    contamination typology 信息（uniform vs selective）。P2 优先级——主要贡献在 Discussion/Methodology\n654\t    部分。\n655\t\n656\t    '\n657\t- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test (GRPO after SFT contamination)\n658\t  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n659\t  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 上：SFT 15% MMLU 污染 → GRPO 训练 → 评估 lz*/HT/MIA\n660\t    在 post-RL 条件下的信号保留。回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效发现和 R7/R12 reviewer concerns。\n661\t\n662\t    '\n663\t  expected_results:\n664\t    sft_lz_star: 3.85\n665\t    sft_lz_star_d: -3.42\n666\t    sft_ht_d: 3.21\n667\t    sft_mia_mink_auroc: 0.611\n668\t    sft_acc_seen: 0.831\n669\t    postrl_lz_star: 4.95\n670\t    postrl_lz_star_d: -2.65\n671\t    postrl_delta_lz_from_clean: -3.73\n672\t    postrl_signal_retention_lz: 0.77\n673\t    postrl_ht: 0.17\n674\t    postrl_ht_d: 0.65\n675\t    postrl_ht_signal_retention: 0.2\n676\t    postrl_mia_loss_auroc: 0.49\n677\t    postrl_mia_mink_auroc: 0.51\n678\t    postrl_mia_minkpp_auroc: 0.5\n679\t    postrl_acc: 0.718\n680\t    postrl_acc_seen: 0.795\n681\t    postrl_acc_unseen: 0.705\n682\t    postrl_theta: 0.28\n683\t    postrl_memorization_fraction: 0.32\n684\t    lz_star_vs_ht_retention_ratio: 3.85\n685\t    n_methods_surviving_rl: 2\n686\t    n_methods_failing_rl: 4\n687\t  result_rationale: 'BEST 档的 headline result：lz* 在 GRPO 后保留 77% 信号（d=-2.65， 仍为大效应），而\n688\t    HT 仅保留 20%（d=0.65，小效应）。机制解释：\n689\t\n690\t    **为什么 lz* 存活**：GRPO 通过 reward-based optimization 改善模型 的推理能力，这表现为：(1) overall accuracy\n691\t    从 0.731→0.718（轻微下降 因为 GRPO reward 优化的是 generation quality 非 MC accuracy）， (2)\n692\t    θ_MLE 从 0.197→0.28（ability estimate 上升，因为 GRPO 使模型 在 hard items 上表现更好），(3) seen_acc\n693\t    从 0.831→0.795（记忆化信号 略有衰减——GRPO 的 KL penalty 部分\"洗掉\"了 SFT 阶段的 rote 记忆， 但不完全）。lz*\n694\t    的 4PL 加权对每个 item 的 aberrance 贡献根据 a/b/c/d 参数差异化处理——记忆化 items 的残差结构（高 a items 被答对、\n695\t    低 d items 被答对的特征模式）在 GRPO 后仍然保留，因为 GRPO 改变 token distribution 但不改变 binary response\n696\t    中的 item-specific memorization pattern（模型仍然记得那些题的答案）。\n697\t\n698\t    **为什么 HT 退化**：HT = Σ(x_i - P_i(θ)) 仅按 difficulty 加权。 GRPO 全局提升 θ 后，P_i(θ) 对所有\n699\t    items 系统性增大——模型\"应该\" 答对更多 hard items。这使得 memorized items 的答对不再显得 aberrant （因为模型现在\n700\t    genuinely 有更高能力）。HT 无法区分\"GRPO 带来的 真能力提升\"和\"SFT 记忆化的残留\"。\n701\t\n702\t    **为什么 MIA 失效**：GRPO 的 policy gradient updates 彻底重塑 token-level loss landscape（Wang\n703\t    et al. 2025），使 per-token loss 分布不再携带 contamination 信号。AUROC→0.50 复现 Wang et al.。\n704\t\n705\t    **memorization_fraction 从 0.38→0.32**：GRPO 的 KL regularization \"洗掉\"了约 16% 的记忆化信号（(0.38-0.32)/0.38），但大部分保留。\n706\t    这与 lz* 的 retention ratio 0.77 数量级一致。\n707\t\n708\t    '\n709\t  tables:\n710\t  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Signal Retention'\n711\t    columns:\n712\t    - method\n713\t    - info_level\n714\t    - sft_d\n715\t    - postrl_d\n716\t    - retention_pct\n717\t    - survives_rl\n718\t    rows:\n719\t    - - lz* (ours)\n720\t      - binary\n721\t      - -3.42\n722\t      - -2.65\n723\t      - 77%\n724\t      - ✓\n725\t    - - HT\n726\t      - binary+b\n727\t      - 3.21\n728\t      - 0.65\n729\t      - 20%\n730\t      - ✗\n731\t    - - U3/Guttman\n732\t      - binary\n733\t      - -0.43\n734\t      - -0.35\n735\t      - 81%\n736\t      - ✗ (baseline too weak)\n737\t    - - acc z-score\n738\t      - binary\n739\t      - 160.6\n740\t      - 85.0\n741\t      - 53%\n742\t      - ✓ (but non-specific)\n743\t    - - Min-K%\n744\t      - token probs\n745\t      - 0.611\n746\t      - 0.51\n747\t      - ~0%\n748\t      - ✗\n749\t    - - Loss-based\n750\t      - logits\n751\t      - 0.592\n752\t      - 0.49\n753\t      - ~0%\n754\t      - ✗\n755\t    - - ConStat\n756\t      - retest\n757\t      - —\n758\t      - 0.62\n759\t      - —\n760\t      - △ (moderate)\n761\t  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Response Pattern Changes'\n762\t    columns:\n763\t    - metric\n764\t    - sft_only\n765\t    - post_grpo\n766\t    - delta\n767\t    rows:\n768\t    - - accuracy\n769\t      - 0.731\n770\t      - 0.718\n771\t      - -0.013\n772\t    - - acc_seen\n773\t      - 0.831\n774\t      - 0.795\n775\t      - -0.036\n776\t    - - acc_unseen\n777\t      - 0.672\n778\t      - 0.705\n779\t      - 0.033\n780\t    - - theta_MLE\n781\t      - 0.197\n782\t      - 0.28\n783\t      - 0.083\n784\t    - - lz_star\n785\t      - 3.85\n786\t      - 4.95\n787\t      - 1.1\n788\t    - - memorization_fraction\n789\t      - 0.38\n790\t      - 0.32\n791\t      - -0.06\n792\t  figures_description:\n793\t  - 'Figure: Signal retention comparison (grouped bar: SFT vs post-RL for each method)'\n794\t  - 'Figure: Detection frontier with post-RL overlay — methods shift along frontier\n795\t    after RL'\n796\t  - 'Figure: seen/unseen accuracy decomposition pre- and post-RL'\n797\t  analysis: 'BEST 档的 crown jewel。lz* 是唯一在 post-RL 后仍保持大效应的 binary-only 检测方法。HT 的退化（d:\n798\t    3.21→0.65）提供了 lz* vs HT 的 empirical 差异化——直接回应 R12。叙事升级为：\"4PL parameterization\n799\t    provides not just detection power (8× Guttman/U3) but RL robustness that difficulty-only\n800\t    statistics lack.\" post-RL 条件下 MIA 家族 全面失效复现 Wang et al.，证明 binary response patterns\n801\t    是唯一 对 RL distributional shift 结构性免疫的信息来源。\n802\t\n803\t    '\n804\t- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\n805\t  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n806\t  description: 'BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap，验证\n807\t    power function 在中等规模 benchmark 上的预测。\n808\t\n809\t    '\n810\t  expected_results:\n811\t    bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.82\n812\t    bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.85\n813\t    bbh_theory_sim_gap: 0.03\n814\t    bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15: -2.5\n815\t    math_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n816\t    math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.76\n817\t    math_theory_sim_gap: 0.04\n818\t    math_ctrl_contam_d_15: -2.1\n819\t    power_function_R2_with_extra: 0.97\n820\t    min_items_for_80pct_power_validated: true\n821\t  result_rationale: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 位于 GSM8K (1319) 和 HellaSwag\n822\t    (10042) 之间的 power gap 区域。power function 预测 detection power 随 √n_items 增长——BBH\n823\t    在 15% 污染下 power ≈82% （介于 GSM8K 的 59% 和 HellaSwag 的 75% 之间），MATH ≈72%。 这些中间数据点将\n824\t    power function R² 从 0.957（仅有 5 benchmarks） 提升至 ~0.97（7 benchmarks），增强了 empirical\n825\t    power function 作为 practical guidance 的可信度。ctrl-contam 在这两个 benchmark 上的 |d| 分别约\n826\t    2.5 和 2.1，低于 MMLU 的 3.42 但仍为大效应—— 与 n_items 的 power 预测一致。BBH 的 compositional reasoning\n827\t    items 和 MATH 的 mathematical reasoning items 与 MMLU 的 knowledge-based items 在 IRT\n828\t    参数分布上不同（b 更高、a 可能更高）， 可能带来 domain-specific 的 power 差异。\n829\t\n830\t    '\n831\t  tables:\n832\t  - name: 'Table: Power Function Validation (7 Benchmarks)'\n833\t    columns:\n834\t    - benchmark\n835\t    - n_items\n836\t    - sim_power_15pct\n837\t    - theoretical_power\n838\t    - gap\n839\t    rows:\n840\t    - - MMLU\n841\t      - 14042\n842\t      - 0.979\n843\t      - 0.985\n844\t      - 0.006\n845\t    - - HellaSwag\n846\t      - 10042\n847\t      - 0.753\n848\t      - 0.78\n849\t      - 0.027\n850\t    - - BBH\n851\t      - 6511\n852\t      - 0.82\n853\t      - 0.85\n854\t      - 0.03\n855\t    - - MATH\n856\t      - 5000\n857\t      - 0.72\n858\t      - 0.76\n859\t      - 0.04\n860\t    - - GSM8K\n861\t      - 1319\n862\t      - 0.578\n863\t      - 0.62\n864\t      - 0.042\n865\t    - - ARC-C\n866\t      - 295\n867\t      - 0.129\n868\t      - 0.18\n869\t      - 0.051\n870\t    - - HumanEval\n871\t      - 164\n872\t      - 0.243\n873\t      - 0.12\n874\t      - '-0.123'\n875\t  figures_description:\n876\t  - 'Power curve: theoretical line + empirical points for 7 benchmarks, with 95% CI\n877\t    bands'\n878\t  analysis: 'BBH 和 MATH 验证了 power function 在 5K-7K 区间的预测精度。 combined R²=0.97 支撑 \"approximate\n879\t    practical guidance\" 的 framing。 实验需要确认 PSN-IRT 是否包含这两个 benchmark 的 4PL 参数—— 如果没有，需要自行校准（GPU\n880\t    密集型），可能降级为 future work。\n881\t\n882\t    '\n883\t- name: MMLU Domain-Level Person-Fit Analysis\n884\t  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n885\t  description: '按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别 contamination 是全面的还是集中在特定\n886\t    domain。\n887\t\n888\t    '\n889\t  expected_results:\n890\t    gemini_subjects_flagged: 50/57\n891\t    gemini_contamination_pattern: uniform (all domains)\n892\t    gemini_category_lz:\n893\t      STEM: 21.2\n894\t      Humanities: 17.9\n895\t      Social_Sciences: 15.9\n896\t      Other: 15.3\n897\t    doubao_pattern: selective (Humanities/Social Sciences negative)\n898\t    doubao_category_lz:\n899\t      STEM: -2.0\n900\t      Humanities: -13.0\n901\t      Social_Sciences: -14.8\n902\t      Other: 4.4\n903\t    hunyuan_pattern: uneven (Social Sciences anomalous)\n904\t    ctrl_contam_domain_uniformity: true\n905\t    ctrl_contam_seen_unseen_domain_consistent: true\n906\t  result_rationale: 'Domain-level 分析增强了 IRT-FIT 的 interpretability 叙事。 Gemini-1.5\n907\t    在 50/57 subjects 上被 flagged，说明其 100% MMLU accuracy 是 blanket contamination 而非\n908\t    selective 记忆。 Doubao 的 selective pattern（STEM 低负、Humanities 高负、 Other 正）提示不同的\n909\t    contamination 机制——可能 Humanities/Social Sciences 的训练数据中混入了 MMLU items 而 STEM 未受影响。\n910\t    ctrl-contam 的 QLoRA SFT 注入是 uniform random 的，因此 domain 分析应显示 uniform contamination\n911\t    across subjects—— 这验证了实验设计（uniform injection → uniform detection）。 seen/unseen\n912\t    split 的 domain consistency 进一步确认 memorization fingerprint 在 subject level 上也成立。\n913\t\n914\t    '\n915\t  tables:\n916\t  - name: 'Table: Domain-Level lz* (Selected Models)'\n917\t    columns:\n918\t    - model\n919\t    - STEM\n920\t    - Humanities\n921\t    - Social_Sci\n922\t    - Other\n923\t    - pattern\n924\t    rows:\n925\t    - - Gemini-1.5\n926\t      - 21.2\n927\t      - 17.9\n928\t      - 15.9\n929\t      - 15.3\n930\t      - uniform\n931\t    - - Yi-Lightning\n932\t      - 48.2\n933\t      - —\n934\t      - —\n935\t      - —\n936\t      - MMLU concentrated\n937\t    - - Doubao\n938\t      - -2.0\n939\t      - -13.0\n940\t      - -14.8\n941\t      - 4.4\n942\t      - selective\n943\t    - - Hunyuan\n944\t      - 1.8\n945\t      - —\n946\t      - 13.9\n947\t      - —\n948\t      - uneven\n949\t  figures_description:\n950\t  - 'Heatmap: 12 models × 4 domain categories × lz*, clustered by contamination typology'\n951\t  - 'Radar chart: Gemini vs Doubao domain profiles (contrasting uniform vs selective)'\n952\t  analysis: Domain-level 分析是 IRT-FIT 的 unique capability——binary-only 方法中只有 IRT framework\n953\t    可以在 domain 粒度上分解 aberrance。 contamination typology (uniform/selective/uneven)\n954\t    为 leaderboard maintainers 提供了 actionable 信息：不仅检测 whether，还回答 where。\n955\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d433593b-2345-4b63-8713-93a3428b10f3","uuid":"d47bd509-df59-493e-ac7a-3a1a05613d61","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:08:55.929Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122444/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'IRT person-fit is structurally robust to post-RL — the only binary-only\n  method that survives the RL distributional shift that destroys all log-prob methods\n  (Wang et al.) AND simpler person-fit statistics (HT). The 4PL parameterization provides\n  both detection power (8× Guttman/U3) and RL robustness that difficulty-only statistics\n  lack. Minimal-information operating point is not merely a constraint but a structural\n  advantage: binary response patterns are invariant to the token-distribution shifts\n  that GRPO induces, while the 4PL weighting scheme preserves item-specific memorization\n  signatures that difficulty-only HT cannot isolate from global θ-shifts.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct × MMLU)\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct × 4 conditions (0%-s1, 0%-s2, 15%, 50%) × MMLU。\n    验证 Δlz* 显著性、clean-vs-clean noise floor、memorization fraction。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_clean_seeds: 3\n    clean_lz_star_mean: 8.68\n    clean_lz_star_std: 1.41\n    clean_vs_clean_delta_lz: 0.02\n    contam_15_lz_star: 3.85\n    contam_15_delta_lz: -4.83\n    contam_15_cohens_d: -3.42\n    contam_50_lz_star: 7.29\n    contam_50_delta_lz: -1.39\n    contam_50_cohens_d: -0.99\n    theta_fixed_contam15_delta: 3.17\n    theta_fixed_contam50_delta: 9.89\n    theta_fixed_dose_ratio: 3.12\n    memorization_fraction_15pct: 0.38\n    memorization_fraction_50pct: 0.29\n    contam_15_acc_seen: 0.748\n    contam_15_acc_unseen: 0.672\n    go_nogo: go\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 pilot 提供明确 go 信号。contam_15 d=-3.42 是大效应（|d|>2.9）， 验证了\n    lz* 在 SFT 污染下的检测能力。contam_50 free-θ d=-0.99 的\"非单调\" 源于 Qwen 极高的 baseline lz*=8.68——污染抬升\n    θ_MLE 后吸收了 aberrance 信号。θ-fixed 分析恢复单调剂量-反应（ratio=3.12），证明 θ-shift 是可控的 方法学混淆因子而非检测失效。memorization_fraction=0.38\n    表明 SFT 仅使 38% 污染 item 产生真正的记忆化响应（其余经泛化通道提升），这量化了理论 power (97.9%) 与实测检测之间的 gap。clean-vs-clean\n    Δlz*≈0 确认噪声底线可忽略。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Qwen Pilot Results (ℓz*-corrected)'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - accuracy\n    - theta_MLE\n    - lz_star\n    - delta_lz\n    - cohens_d\n    rows:\n    - - clean_mean(n=3)\n      - 0.679\n      - -0.097\n      - 8.68\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - contam_15\n      - 0.731\n      - 0.197\n      - 3.85\n      - -4.83\n      - -3.42\n    - - contam_50\n      - 0.764\n      - 0.37\n      - 7.29\n      - -1.39\n      - -0.99\n  - name: 'Table: θ-fixed Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - theta_fixed\n    - lz_star_fixed\n    - delta_lz_fixed\n    rows:\n    - - clean_mean\n      - -0.097\n      - 8.68\n      - —\n    - - contam_15\n      - -0.097\n      - 11.85\n      - 3.17\n    - - contam_50\n      - -0.097\n      - 18.58\n      - 9.89\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: Δlz* across conditions (free-θ vs θ-fixed), showing monotonicity recovery'\n  - 'Scatter: seen vs unseen item lz* contributions, memorization fingerprint'\n  analysis: 'Pilot 完全成功。Qwen 15% 污染 |d|=3.42 远超检测阈值。θ-fixed 分析 是方法学贡献：揭示了 θ-shift\n    如何混淆 free-θ 下的剂量-反应关系， 并提供了修复方案。memorization fraction 0.38 桥接了理论与实证 power。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Controlled Contamination (4 families × MMLU + cross-benchmark)\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n  description: '4 个模型家族 (Qwen2.5-7B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B-v0.3, Gemma-4-12B) ×\n    6 contamination levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × MMLU 主实验 + GSM8K/HellaSwag 补充。Mistral\n    增加 2 seeds 验证第三家族。 ARC-C θ-fixed 补充分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_mmlu_d_15: -3.42\n    qwen_mmlu_d_50: -0.99\n    qwen_mmlu_d_15_theta_fixed: -2.24\n    llama_mmlu_d_15: -2.95\n    llama_mmlu_d_50: -3.31\n    mistral_clean_lz_mean: 5.35\n    mistral_clean_lz_std: 1.2\n    mistral_contam15_lz: -1.38\n    mistral_delta_lz_15: -6.73\n    mistral_d_15: -5.61\n    mistral_contam50_lz: -3.15\n    mistral_delta_lz_50: -8.5\n    mistral_d_50: -7.08\n    gemma_clean_lz_mean: 3.2\n    gemma_clean_lz_std: 1.05\n    gemma_contam15_lz: -0.85\n    gemma_d_15: -3.86\n    gemma_contam50_lz: -2.1\n    gemma_d_50: -5.05\n    n_families_validated: 4\n    all_families_d15_gt_2: true\n    cross_family_memorization_fraction_range:\n    - 0.33\n    - 0.4\n    arcc_clean_lz_mean: -5.49\n    arcc_clean_lz_std: 0.3\n    arcc_contam15_lz_free: -5.0\n    arcc_contam15_delta_free: 0.49\n    arcc_theta_fixed_d: 2.05\n    arcc_contam50_theta_fixed_d: 3.8\n    gsm8k_qwen_d_15: -1.65\n    hellaswag_qwen_d_15: -2.8\n    dose_response_5pct_d: -0.85\n    dose_response_10pct_d: -2.1\n    dose_response_15pct_d: -3.42\n    dose_response_25pct_d: -3.8\n    dose_response_50pct_d: -0.99\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档的核心假设之一是 n_families_validated ∈ [3,4]。Mistral 单 seed Δlz*=-6.8/-8.6\n    已是所有家族中最大信号——这源于 Mistral 较低的 baseline accuracy (0.514) 和中等 baseline lz* (+5.42)：低能力模型在污染后\n    difficulty-ordering 变化更剧烈（本该答错的难题全答对），产生更强 aberrance。 额外 2 seeds 将确认 clean std≈1.2（介于\n    Qwen 1.41 和 Llama 0.97 之间）， 给出 d≈-5.6，为所有家族中最强。Gemma 作为第四家族提供额外验证： 其 decoder-only\n    架构与 Qwen/Llama 类似，预期 d 在 -2.5 到 -4.0 之间。 ARC-C 仅 295 items，free-θ 信号弱（Δlz*≈0.5），但\n    θ-fixed 放大信号： 固定 θ 避免了污染引起的 θ 上移对小样本统计量的稀释效应。Best 档下 θ-fixed d≈2.05 满足 arcc_theta_fixed_d\n    ∈ [1.5, 3.0] 的目标范围。 跨 benchmark 验证中，GSM8K (1319 items) 信号较弱（d≈-1.65）是 power 函数的直接预测——n_items\n    减少则 detection power 下降；HellaSwag (10042 items) 信号接近 MMLU。剂量-反应在 free-θ 下呈 inverted-U（Qwen\n    特有， 因 baseline misfit 高），θ-fixed 下恢复单调——这是跨所有家族的通用发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family Detection (MMLU, 15% contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - family\n    - clean_lz_mean\n    - clean_std\n    - contam15_lz\n    - delta_lz\n    - cohens_d_n3\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-2.5-7B\n      - 8.68\n      - 1.41\n      - 3.85\n      - -4.83\n      - -3.42\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - -0.14\n      - 0.97\n      - -2.99\n      - -2.85\n      - -2.95\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 5.35\n      - 1.2\n      - -1.38\n      - -6.73\n      - -5.61\n    - - Gemma-4-12B\n      - 3.2\n      - 1.05\n      - -0.85\n      - -4.05\n      - -3.86\n  - name: 'Table: ARC-C θ-fixed Detection (295 items)'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - free_theta_d\n    - theta_fixed_d\n    rows:\n    - - contam_15\n      - 0.65\n      - 2.05\n    - - contam_50\n      - 1.2\n      - 3.8\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Benchmark Detection (Qwen, 15%)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - cohens_d\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - -3.42\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - -2.8\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - -1.65\n    - - ARC-C (θ-fixed)\n      - 295\n      - -2.05\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: Cohen''s d across 4 families × 6 contamination levels × MMLU'\n  - 'Power curve: detection power vs n_items (theoretical + empirical overlay)'\n  - Cross-family baseline lz* divergence plot showing Qwen +8.7, Mistral +5.4, Gemma\n    +3.2, Llama -0.1\n  analysis: '4 家族全部在 15% 污染下达到 |d|>2.9（Mistral d=-5.61 最强，Llama d=-2.95 最弱但仍为大效应）。clean\n    baseline lz* 跨家族跨度 ~9σ 证明绝对阈值 不可行——IRT-FIT 必须是 Δlz*/Cohen''s d 相对检测框架。ARC-C θ-fixed\n    d=2.05 验证了小 benchmark 检测可行性，完成 power 函数的实证验证。\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard v1 Large-Scale Audit (ABANDONED)\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n  description: '对 13K+ 模型计算 person-fit，绘制 per-benchmark 污染率趋势。 因 v1 IRT refit 失败 (a_r=0.127)\n    而放弃。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: abandoned\n    reason: a_r=0.127 << 0.2 threshold — classical refit discrimination failure\n    data_availability_noted: true\n  result_rationale: '即使在 best 档下，v1 IRT refit 的结构性失败（discrimination a_r=0.127，N=178\n    仍未改善）不依赖于 post-RL 结果。经典 IRT MML-EM 对 LLM response matrix 的估计要求远超可用样本量。 13K+ per-item\n    data 可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work 作为社区资源。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'ABANDONED。不影响 best-tier 叙事。v1 数据可用性本身是一个贡献点 （社区资源），但大规模审计需要 neural IRT\n    或其他参数估计方法。\n\n    '\n- name: v1 Leaderboard Base→Chat Natural Experiment\n  plan_id: exp-natural-experiment\n  description: '利用 v1 leaderboard 中 base→chat 配对模型，计算 Δlz* 作为 SFT 效应代理。 21 pairs ×\n    4 benchmarks。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_pairs: 21\n    n_complete_pairs: 9\n    hellaswag_mean_deviation: -3.4\n    hellaswag_t_stat: -3.97\n    hellaswag_p: 0.001\n    gsm8k_mean_deviation: 3.92\n    gsm8k_t_stat: 3.35\n    gsm8k_p: 0.009\n    mmlu_p: 0.15\n    arc_c_p: 0.38\n    individual_outliers: 0\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下此实验提供 converging evidence：SFT 对 person-fit 有系统性 效应（HellaSwag\n    和 GSM8K 方向相反——HellaSwag SFT 降低 lz* 而 GSM8K 提升），但无个体 pair 显示 benchmark-specific\n    污染 outlier。这与 \"SFT 改变 response pattern 但不一定是污染\"一致。HellaSwag 负方向 可能反映 chat 模型在常识推理上的\n    pattern 改变（更 aberrant）， GSM8K 正方向反映 SFT 提升数学能力的 consistent pattern。 但受限于 v1 refit\n    的 a_r 问题，此结果仅作为辅助证据（P2-optional）， 不进入核心叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: SFT Effect on lz* (Base→Chat Pairs)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - mean_Δlz\n    - t_stat\n    - p_value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - -3.4\n      - -3.97\n      - 0.001\n      - SFT decreases person-fit\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 3.92\n      - 3.35\n      - 0.009\n      - SFT increases person-fit\n    - - MMLU\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.15\n      - n.s.\n    - - ARC-C\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.38\n      - n.s.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired dot plot: base vs chat lz* per benchmark, with connecting lines'\n  analysis: 'P2-optional。两个 benchmark 达显著但方向相反，说明 SFT 效应是 benchmark-specific 的。不进入主要叙事但可作为\n    Discussion 中的 补充证据。\n\n    '\n- name: v1 IRT Refit Expanded (N=178)\n  plan_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n  description: '扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N=178，验证 pilot N=63 的 a_r=0.111 是否因样本量不足。关闭 Path\n    D。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models: 178\n    n_items: 14042\n    3pl_a_pearson_r: 0.127\n    2pl_a_pearson_r: -0.029\n    3pl_b_pearson_r: 0.663\n    path_d_status: dead\n  result_rationale: 'N 从 63→178（2.8×）但 a_r 仅从 0.111→0.127，仍远低于 0.2 阈值。 discrimination\n    估计失败的根因是 LLM response matrix 的结构：(1) 模型间 能力分布高度集中（多数 7B-70B 模型 θ 分布窄），(2) LLM\n    response pattern 违反 local independence（同一知识域的 items 高度相关），(3) N=178 对于 14042 items\n    的 IRT 估计仍远不够（经典 IRT 要求 N/items > 10）。 b_r=0.663 说明 difficulty 估计相对稳健（b 主要由 item\n    pass rate 决定）， 但 discrimination 需要更精细的 ability 分离。这一 negative result 关闭了 \"用 v1\n    数据自行重估 IRT 参数\"路径，确认必须依赖 PSN-IRT 的 validated 4PL parameters。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: IRT Refit Correlation with PSN-IRT'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - parameter\n    - N_63\n    - N_178\n    - threshold\n    rows:\n    - - 3PL\n      - a (discrimination)\n      - 0.111\n      - 0.127\n      - '>0.4'\n    - - 3PL\n      - b (difficulty)\n      - 0.626\n      - 0.663\n      - '>0.5 ✓'\n    - - 2PL\n      - a (discrimination)\n      - -0.084\n      - -0.029\n      - '>0.4'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Negative result → 方法学 caveat。论文中报告为\"classical IRT estimation challenges\n    in LLM contexts\"，量化了经典 IRT 与 neural IRT 的 sample size gap。写入 Section 6 (Empirical\n    Findings)。\n\n    '\n- name: 4PL vs 3PL(d=1) Ablation\n  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n  description: '比较 4PL 与 3PL(d=1) 参数化下的 FAR 和 detection power， 量化 feasibility parameter\n    d 的贡献。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    far_4pl: 0.05\n    far_3pl: 4.7%-16.5% (inflated)\n    far_2pl: 50%-100% (catastrophic)\n    mean_power_gain_mmlu: 27.3\n    mean_power_gain_hellaswag: 26.1\n    mean_power_gain_gsm8k: 20.3\n    pct_items_d_lt_095: 0.46\n    correlation_4pl_vs_3pl_real_data: 0.225\n    deepseek_v3_delta: 357\n  result_rationale: '4PL d 参数对 LLM contamination detection 至关重要，因为 MMLU 中 46% items\n    的 d<0.95——这些 items 的 upper asymptote 显著低于 1.0（即使 高能力模型也不能完美作答）。3PL(d=1) 假设所有 items\n    的上限为 1.0， 导致高能力模型在这些 items 上的\"正常失误\"被错误标记为 aberrant （inflated FAR），同时真正的 contamination-induced\n    aberrance 被稀释 （reduced power）。对于 DeepSeek-V3 (θ=3.77) 这样的高能力模型， 3PL 计算的 lz* 偏离\n    4PL 达 357 个单位——完全不可信。2PL 更糟， 去除 guessing 参数 c 后 FAR 达 50-100%。这一消融直接回应 R8 (\"4PL\n    vs 3PL — does d parameter matter?\")，答案是\"absolutely yes\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: FAR and Power by Parameterization'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - far\n    - power_mmlu_15\n    - power_hellaswag_15\n    rows:\n    - - 4PL\n      - 5.0%\n      - 97.9%\n      - 73.3%\n    - - 3PL(d=1)\n      - 4.7-16.5%\n      - 70.6%\n      - 47.2%\n    - - 2PL(c=0 d=1)\n      - 50-100%\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table: Real-Data lz* Divergence (4PL vs 3PL)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - theta\n    - lz_4pl\n    - lz_3pl\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - DeepSeek-V3\n      - 3.77\n      - 16.4\n      - -340.6\n      - 357\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - 0.78\n      - 31.8\n      - 28.1\n      - 3.7\n    - - Gemma-2B-it\n      - -2.01\n      - -8.3\n      - -9.5\n      - 1.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Power curve overlay: 4PL vs 3PL across contamination levels × benchmarks'\n  - 'Scatter: 4PL lz* vs 3PL lz* for 12 models, colored by θ'\n  analysis: '4PL d 参数提供平均 +20-27pp power gain，是 lz* 检测力的核心来源之一。 这直接支撑 \"full 4PL parameterization\"\n    叙事：lz* 之所以优于 HT/U3/Guttman， 不仅因为它考虑了 discrimination，更因为它正确处理了 upper asymptote。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Baseline Comparison (≥5 baselines including ConStat & MIA)\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: '在 ctrl-contam ground-truth 数据上比较 IRT-FIT vs ≥5 baselines： (1) acc\n    z-score, (2) HT, (3) U3/Guttman, (4) ConStat (re-test), (5) Min-K%/Min-K%++ (token\n    probs), (6) PPL-based, (7) random。 包含 post-RL 条件下的 baseline 对比（与 exp-post-rl 联合分析）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lz_star_d_qwen15: -3.42\n    lz_star_d_llama15: -2.95\n    ht_d_qwen15: 3.21\n    ht_d_llama15: 3.53\n    u3_d_qwen15: -0.43\n    guttman_d_qwen15: -0.43\n    acc_zscore_qwen15: 160.6\n    constat_retest_auroc_sft: 0.65\n    constat_retest_auroc_postrl: 0.62\n    constat_info_required: rephrased benchmark items (more than binary)\n    mink_base_auroc: 0.493\n    mink_sft_auroc: 0.611\n    mink_postrl_auroc: 0.51\n    minkpp_sft_auroc: 0.569\n    loss_sft_auroc: 0.592\n    loss_postrl_auroc: 0.49\n    postrl_lz_star_d: -2.5\n    postrl_ht_d: 0.65\n    postrl_mia_auroc: 0.51\n    postrl_acc_zscore_d: 85.0\n    n_baselines_beaten: 6\n    lz_star_signal_retention_ratio: 0.73\n    ht_signal_retention_ratio: 0.2\n    item_auroc_lz_itemwise: 0.535\n    item_auroc_irt_residual: 0.58\n    item_auroc_lr_cross: 0.59\n    item_auroc_rf_oracle: 0.63\n    item_auroc_random: 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下，lz* 击败 6 个 baselines（acc z-score 除外——它在 SFT 场景 trivially\n    检测但缺乏 specificity）。关键差异化在 post-RL 条件：\n\n    (a) HT d 从 3.21→0.65（retention 20%）：HT 仅用 item difficulty (b) 加权， GRPO 全局提升模型能力后，模型在更多\n    hard items 上正确作答——这些 \"正确\"既包含真正的能力提升也包含记忆化 items。HT 无法区分二者， 因为它的 aberrance 定义是\"答对了不该答对的题\"（基于\n    difficulty）， 而 GRPO 系统性降低了\"不该答对\"的阈值。\n\n    (b) lz* d 从 -3.42→-2.50（retention 73%）：lz* 用 a/b/c/d 四参数 加权每个 item 的 aberrance\n    贡献。memorized items 的响应模式不仅仅是 \"答对了难题\"，而是在 4PL 参数空间中呈现特定的残差结构——高 discrimination\n    items 被答对的模式、low-feasibility items 被答对的模式——这些精细结构 在 GRPO 后仍保留，因为 GRPO 改变的是 token-level\n    generation 策略， 不改变 binary response pattern 中的 item-specific 记忆化签名。\n\n    (c) MIA/Min-K% AUROC 从 0.611→0.51：Wang et al. (2025) 已证明 RL post-training 完全破坏\n    token-level loss landscape。Best 档复现此结果。\n\n    (d) ConStat AUROC=0.65（SFT）/0.62（post-RL）：ConStat 需要 rephrased retest items（信息量严格大于\n    binary patterns），但检测力仅为 moderate。 这证明更多信息并不自动转化为更好检测——IRT framework 的 structural\n    advantage 弥补了信息量的差距。\n\n    Item-level 所有方法 AUROC 0.50-0.63 的一致性证明污染信号是 diffuse 的 （memorization fraction ~35%），只有\n    model-level aggregation 才能 将 14K 个 weak signals 聚合为 strong detection。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Model-Level Detection Comparison (15% contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - info_required\n    - qwen_d\n    - llama_d\n    - postrl_d\n    - postrl_retention\n    rows:\n    - - lz* (ours)\n      - binary only\n      - -3.42\n      - -2.95\n      - -2.5\n      - 73%\n    - - HT\n      - binary + difficulty\n      - 3.21\n      - 3.53\n      - 0.65\n      - 20%\n    - - U3/Guttman\n      - binary only\n      - -0.43\n      - -3.69\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - acc z-score\n      - binary only\n      - 160.6\n      - 35.4\n      - 85.0\n      - 53%\n    - - ConStat\n      - rephrased retest\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.62\n      - —\n    - - Min-K%\n      - token probs\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.51\n      - ~0%\n    - - Loss-based\n      - full logits\n      - —\n      - —\n      - 0.49\n      - ~0%\n  - name: 'Table: Item-Level AUROC (all methods near-random)'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - qwen_15\n    - qwen_50\n    - llama_15\n    - llama_50\n    rows:\n    - - lz* itemwise\n      - 0.536\n      - 0.535\n      - 0.528\n      - 0.536\n    - - IRT residual\n      - 0.578\n      - 0.563\n      - 0.582\n      - 0.581\n    - - LR cross-model\n      - 0.586\n      - 0.567\n      - 0.592\n      - 0.586\n    - - RF oracle\n      - —\n      - 0.63\n      - —\n      - 0.629\n    - - random\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Radar chart: 7 methods × detection metrics (d, AUROC, retention), showing lz*\n    dominance post-RL'\n  - 'Detection frontier diagram: y=detection power, x=information required, methods\n    positioned along frontier'\n  - 'Bar chart: signal retention ratio (post-RL / pre-RL) per method'\n  analysis: 'Best 档下 lz* 在 post-RL 场景的信号保留率 (73%) 是所有方法中最高的， 击败 6/7 baselines。HT 的\n    post-RL 退化 (retention 20%) 是 best 档的 headline 差异化结果——直接回应 R12 (\"HT ≈ ℓz* — why\n    use ℓz*?\")。 ConStat 需更多信息但检测力反而更弱，证明 minimal-information operating point 是 structural\n    advantage 而非 constraint。n_baselines_beaten=6 满足 best-tier 目标 [5,7]。\n\n    '\n- name: Multiscale lzm Statistic (Cross-Benchmark Aggregation)\n  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm 统计量： 跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化\n    lz* 总分。在 PSN-IRT 12 模型 + ctrl-contam 模型上验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gemini15_lzm: 42.5\n    yi_lightning_lzm: 38.2\n    qwen_plus_lzm: 35.8\n    doubao_lzm: 18.9\n    gemma2b_lzm: -12.3\n    qwen_clean_lzm: 8.68\n    qwen_contam15_lzm: 3.85\n    qwen_contam15_d_lzm: -3.42\n    cross_bench_lzm_vs_single_improvement: +15-25% separation\n    lzm_ranking_kendall_tau_vs_lz_mmlu: 0.82\n  result_rationale: 'lzm 将多个 benchmark 的 lz* 标准化后求和，利用独立 benchmark 间的 互补信息。对 12 模型\n    case study，跨 5 benchmarks 聚合后 Gemini-1.5 的 lzm 远高于其他模型——因为它在所有 5 benchmarks 上都有\n    extreme positive lz*（uniform contamination 模式）。Doubao 的 selective flagging pattern（STEM\n    -2, Humanities -13, Social Sciences -14.8, Other +4.4）在 lzm 中被部分抵消，产生 moderate\n    lzm。对 ctrl-contam 数据，当前仅有 MMLU 单 benchmark，lzm = lz*，但 concept validation 成功：未来扩展到多\n    benchmark contamination 后 lzm 将提供更 robust 的整体污染指标。lzm 与单 benchmark lz* 的 Kendall\n    tau=0.82 说明 排序基本一致但有信息增益。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: lzm Ranking (PSN-IRT 12 Models)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - lzm\n    - mmlu_lz\n    - hellaswag_lz\n    - gsm8k_lz\n    - contamination_type\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - 42.5\n      - 31.8\n      - 28.5\n      - 12.3\n      - uniform (all benchmarks)\n    - - Yi-Lightning\n      - 38.2\n      - 48.2\n      - 18.9\n      - 2.1\n      - MMLU-concentrated\n    - - Qwen-Plus\n      - 35.8\n      - 44.9\n      - 15.2\n      - 5.8\n      - MMLU-concentrated\n    - - Doubao\n      - 18.9\n      - -8.5\n      - 25.3\n      - 6.8\n      - selective (non-MMLU)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: per-benchmark lz* contribution to lzm for each model'\n  analysis: 'lzm 在 single-benchmark ctrl-contam 设置下退化为 lz*，但在 12 模型 case study 中提供了额外的\n    contamination typology 信息（uniform vs selective）。P2 优先级——主要贡献在 Discussion/Methodology\n    部分。\n\n    '\n- name: Post-RL Hypothesis Test (GRPO after SFT contamination)\n  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n  description: '在 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 上：SFT 15% MMLU 污染 → GRPO 训练 → 评估 lz*/HT/MIA\n    在 post-RL 条件下的信号保留。回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效发现和 R7/R12 reviewer concerns。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_lz_star: 3.85\n    sft_lz_star_d: -3.42\n    sft_ht_d: 3.21\n    sft_mia_mink_auroc: 0.611\n    sft_acc_seen: 0.831\n    postrl_lz_star: 4.95\n    postrl_lz_star_d: -2.65\n    postrl_delta_lz_from_clean: -3.73\n    postrl_signal_retention_lz: 0.77\n    postrl_ht: 0.17\n    postrl_ht_d: 0.65\n    postrl_ht_signal_retention: 0.2\n    postrl_mia_loss_auroc: 0.49\n    postrl_mia_mink_auroc: 0.51\n    postrl_mia_minkpp_auroc: 0.5\n    postrl_acc: 0.718\n    postrl_acc_seen: 0.795\n    postrl_acc_unseen: 0.705\n    postrl_theta: 0.28\n    postrl_memorization_fraction: 0.32\n    lz_star_vs_ht_retention_ratio: 3.85\n    n_methods_surviving_rl: 2\n    n_methods_failing_rl: 4\n  result_rationale: 'BEST 档的 headline result：lz* 在 GRPO 后保留 77% 信号（d=-2.65， 仍为大效应），而\n    HT 仅保留 20%（d=0.65，小效应）。机制解释：\n\n    **为什么 lz* 存活**：GRPO 通过 reward-based optimization 改善模型 的推理能力，这表现为：(1) overall accuracy\n    从 0.731→0.718（轻微下降 因为 GRPO reward 优化的是 generation quality 非 MC accuracy）， (2)\n    θ_MLE 从 0.197→0.28（ability estimate 上升，因为 GRPO 使模型 在 hard items 上表现更好），(3) seen_acc\n    从 0.831→0.795（记忆化信号 略有衰减——GRPO 的 KL penalty 部分\"洗掉\"了 SFT 阶段的 rote 记忆， 但不完全）。lz*\n    的 4PL 加权对每个 item 的 aberrance 贡献根据 a/b/c/d 参数差异化处理——记忆化 items 的残差结构（高 a items 被答对、\n    低 d items 被答对的特征模式）在 GRPO 后仍然保留，因为 GRPO 改变 token distribution 但不改变 binary response\n    中的 item-specific memorization pattern（模型仍然记得那些题的答案）。\n\n    **为什么 HT 退化**：HT = Σ(x_i - P_i(θ)) 仅按 difficulty 加权。 GRPO 全局提升 θ 后，P_i(θ) 对所有\n    items 系统性增大——模型\"应该\" 答对更多 hard items。这使得 memorized items 的答对不再显得 aberrant （因为模型现在\n    genuinely 有更高能力）。HT 无法区分\"GRPO 带来的 真能力提升\"和\"SFT 记忆化的残留\"。\n\n    **为什么 MIA 失效**：GRPO 的 policy gradient updates 彻底重塑 token-level loss landscape（Wang\n    et al. 2025），使 per-token loss 分布不再携带 contamination 信号。AUROC→0.50 复现 Wang et al.。\n\n    **memorization_fraction 从 0.38→0.32**：GRPO 的 KL regularization \"洗掉\"了约 16% 的记忆化信号（(0.38-0.32)/0.38），但大部分保留。\n    这与 lz* 的 retention ratio 0.77 数量级一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Signal Retention'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - info_level\n    - sft_d\n    - postrl_d\n    - retention_pct\n    - survives_rl\n    rows:\n    - - lz* (ours)\n      - binary\n      - -3.42\n      - -2.65\n      - 77%\n      - ✓\n    - - HT\n      - binary+b\n      - 3.21\n      - 0.65\n      - 20%\n      - ✗\n    - - U3/Guttman\n      - binary\n      - -0.43\n      - -0.35\n      - 81%\n      - ✗ (baseline too weak)\n    - - acc z-score\n      - binary\n      - 160.6\n      - 85.0\n      - 53%\n      - ✓ (but non-specific)\n    - - Min-K%\n      - token probs\n      - 0.611\n      - 0.51\n      - ~0%\n      - ✗\n    - - Loss-based\n      - logits\n      - 0.592\n      - 0.49\n      - ~0%\n      - ✗\n    - - ConStat\n      - retest\n      - —\n      - 0.62\n      - —\n      - △ (moderate)\n  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Response Pattern Changes'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - sft_only\n    - post_grpo\n    - delta\n    rows:\n    - - accuracy\n      - 0.731\n      - 0.718\n      - -0.013\n    - - acc_seen\n      - 0.831\n      - 0.795\n      - -0.036\n    - - acc_unseen\n      - 0.672\n      - 0.705\n      - 0.033\n    - - theta_MLE\n      - 0.197\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.083\n    - - lz_star\n      - 3.85\n      - 4.95\n      - 1.1\n    - - memorization_fraction\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.32\n      - -0.06\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Signal retention comparison (grouped bar: SFT vs post-RL for each method)'\n  - 'Figure: Detection frontier with post-RL overlay — methods shift along frontier\n    after RL'\n  - 'Figure: seen/unseen accuracy decomposition pre- and post-RL'\n  analysis: 'BEST 档的 crown jewel。lz* 是唯一在 post-RL 后仍保持大效应的 binary-only 检测方法。HT 的退化（d:\n    3.21→0.65）提供了 lz* vs HT 的 empirical 差异化——直接回应 R12。叙事升级为：\"4PL parameterization\n    provides not just detection power (8× Guttman/U3) but RL robustness that difficulty-only\n    statistics lack.\" post-RL 条件下 MIA 家族 全面失效复现 Wang et al.，证明 binary response patterns\n    是唯一 对 RL distributional shift 结构性免疫的信息来源。\n\n    '\n- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\n  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n  description: 'BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap，验证\n    power function 在中等规模 benchmark 上的预测。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.82\n    bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.85\n    bbh_theory_sim_gap: 0.03\n    bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15: -2.5\n    math_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n    math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.76\n    math_theory_sim_gap: 0.04\n    math_ctrl_contam_d_15: -2.1\n    power_function_R2_with_extra: 0.97\n    min_items_for_80pct_power_validated: true\n  result_rationale: 'BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 位于 GSM8K (1319) 和 HellaSwag\n    (10042) 之间的 power gap 区域。power function 预测 detection power 随 √n_items 增长——BBH\n    在 15% 污染下 power ≈82% （介于 GSM8K 的 59% 和 HellaSwag 的 75% 之间），MATH ≈72%。 这些中间数据点将\n    power function R² 从 0.957（仅有 5 benchmarks） 提升至 ~0.97（7 benchmarks），增强了 empirical\n    power function 作为 practical guidance 的可信度。ctrl-contam 在这两个 benchmark 上的 |d| 分别约\n    2.5 和 2.1，低于 MMLU 的 3.42 但仍为大效应—— 与 n_items 的 power 预测一致。BBH 的 compositional reasoning\n    items 和 MATH 的 mathematical reasoning items 与 MMLU 的 knowledge-based items 在 IRT\n    参数分布上不同（b 更高、a 可能更高）， 可能带来 domain-specific 的 power 差异。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Power Function Validation (7 Benchmarks)'\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - sim_power_15pct\n    - theoretical_power\n    - gap\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 14042\n      - 0.979\n      - 0.985\n      - 0.006\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 10042\n      - 0.753\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.027\n    - - BBH\n      - 6511\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.03\n    - - MATH\n      - 5000\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.04\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.578\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.042\n    - - ARC-C\n      - 295\n      - 0.129\n      - 0.18\n      - 0.051\n    - - HumanEval\n      - 164\n      - 0.243\n      - 0.12\n      - '-0.123'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Power curve: theoretical line + empirical points for 7 benchmarks, with 95% CI\n    bands'\n  analysis: 'BBH 和 MATH 验证了 power function 在 5K-7K 区间的预测精度。 combined R²=0.97 支撑 \"approximate\n    practical guidance\" 的 framing。 实验需要确认 PSN-IRT 是否包含这两个 benchmark 的 4PL 参数—— 如果没有，需要自行校准（GPU\n    密集型），可能降级为 future work。\n\n    '\n- name: MMLU Domain-Level Person-Fit Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n  description: '按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别 contamination 是全面的还是集中在特定\n    domain。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gemini_subjects_flagged: 50/57\n    gemini_contamination_pattern: uniform (all domains)\n    gemini_category_lz:\n      STEM: 21.2\n      Humanities: 17.9\n      Social_Sciences: 15.9\n      Other: 15.3\n    doubao_pattern: selective (Humanities/Social Sciences negative)\n    doubao_category_lz:\n      STEM: -2.0\n      Humanities: -13.0\n      Social_Sciences: -14.8\n      Other: 4.4\n    hunyuan_pattern: uneven (Social Sciences anomalous)\n    ctrl_contam_domain_uniformity: true\n    ctrl_contam_seen_unseen_domain_consistent: true\n  result_rationale: 'Domain-level 分析增强了 IRT-FIT 的 interpretability 叙事。 Gemini-1.5\n    在 50/57 subjects 上被 flagged，说明其 100% MMLU accuracy 是 blanket contamination 而非\n    selective 记忆。 Doubao 的 selective pattern（STEM 低负、Humanities 高负、 Other 正）提示不同的\n    contamination 机制——可能 Humanities/Social Sciences 的训练数据中混入了 MMLU items 而 STEM 未受影响。\n    ctrl-contam 的 QLoRA SFT 注入是 uniform random 的，因此 domain 分析应显示 uniform contamination\n    across subjects—— 这验证了实验设计（uniform injection → uniform detection）。 seen/unseen\n    split 的 domain consistency 进一步确认 memorization fingerprint 在 subject level 上也成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Domain-Level lz* (Selected Models)'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - STEM\n    - Humanities\n    - Social_Sci\n    - Other\n    - pattern\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5\n      - 21.2\n      - 17.9\n      - 15.9\n      - 15.3\n      - uniform\n    - - Yi-Lightning\n      - 48.2\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - MMLU concentrated\n    - - Doubao\n      - -2.0\n      - -13.0\n      - -14.8\n      - 4.4\n      - selective\n    - - Hunyuan\n      - 1.8\n      - —\n      - 13.9\n      - —\n      - uneven\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: 12 models × 4 domain categories × lz*, clustered by contamination typology'\n  - 'Radar chart: Gemini vs Doubao domain profiles (contrasting uniform vs selective)'\n  analysis: Domain-level 分析是 IRT-FIT 的 unique capability——binary-only 方法中只有 IRT framework\n    可以在 domain 粒度上分解 aberrance。 contamination typology (uniform/selective/uneven)\n    为 leaderboard maintainers 提供了 actionable 信息：不仅检测 whether，还回答 where。\n","numLines":955,"startLine":1,"totalLines":955}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JxELp8XBe87cZHjFCmYeqn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me carefully review this paper and the experiment context. I've read the full PDF (8 pages) and the review_context.yaml. Now I need to:\n\n1. Thoroughly review the paper against EMNLP 2026 standards\n2. Submit the review via `submit_dream_review_report`\n\nLet me first search for the tool schema since ToolSearch didn't find it initially.\n\nLet me analyze the paper systematically:\n\n**Title**: Detecting Benchmark Contamination from Binary Response Patterns via IRT Person-Fit Statistics\n\n**Core Idea**: Use IRT person-fit statistics (ℓz*) with externally calibrated 4PL item parameters to detect benchmark contamination in LLMs, requiring only binary (correct/incorrect) response patterns.\n\n\nThe paper makes several key claims: ℓz* successfully detects 15% contamination with effect sizes exceeding 2.9 across four model families, and it's the only binary-only method that maintains 77% retention after reinforcement learning compared to hypothesis testing's 20%. The 4PL model provides both stronger detection power—27 percentage points better than 3PL—and greater robustness to post-RL fine-tuning. The authors also report universal model misfit across 57 out of 60 test cells and demonstrate a power function relationship with R²=0.97 across seven benchmarks. Now I'm checking how these experiments align with the imagined experiments described in the review context. The paper includes extra benchmarks with BBH and MATH results in Table 5, plus domain analysis in Table 7—essentially covering all planned experiments comprehensively. Looking at the strengths, the IRT person-fit approach for contamination detection is genuinely novel, especially the ability to work with only binary responses. The experimental design is thorough across four model families and multiple contamination levels, and the post-RL robustness finding is particularly compelling—the method retains 77% signal after GRPO while other approaches collapse.\n\nThe θ-fixed analysis elegantly addresses confounding by showing how fixing parameters to clean baselines recovers monotonic dose-response curves, and the 4PL ablation with DeepSeek-V3 provides strong empirical justification for the full parameterization. The universal misfit observation across 57 of 60 cases independently validates the Δℓz* design choice. The writing is clear and efficient despite covering substantial ground in seven pages.\n\nOn weaknesses, the framework's heavy reliance on external IRT parameters is a significant limitation—the entire approach depends on PSN estimates that may not generalize across different model families or domains. The clean baseline requirement is really the biggest practical barrier here — you need three genuinely uncontaminated versions of the same model, which is nearly impossible for production systems like GPT-4 or Claude. The paper acknowledges this limitation but doesn't propose workarounds.\n\nBeyond that, the experiments only test QLoRA fine-tuning as the contamination mechanism, when real-world contamination could happen through pretraining data, full fine-tuning, continued pretraining, or RLHF with contaminated rewards — these might produce very different memorization patterns than what they're detecting. The post-RL results are also based on a single model (Qwen) at a single contamination level (15%), so replicating across different model families and contamination levels would be needed to support such a central claim.\n\nThe statistical power is also concerning — with only three clean seeds, the Cohen's d estimates have very wide confidence intervals, yet the paper reports them to two decimal places without any uncertainty quantification. On top of that, the item-level detection barely works (AUROC of 0.53-0.63), which means the method can flag a contaminated model but can't actually tell you which specific benchmark items were memorized — a significant limitation for maintainers trying to decide what to replace. The accuracy z-score achieves a d value of 160 compared to the main metric's d of 3.42, which is a massive discrepancy that the paper glosses over.\n\nThere's also a puzzling anomaly in Table 5 where HumanEval's simulated power exceeds its theoretical power in the opposite direction from every other benchmark, and this inconsistency goes unaddressed. The paper lacks formal significance testing for its core claims — just reporting d values without p-values or confidence intervals when n=3 really calls for proper statistical inference. The reference list is quite sparse at only 12 citations for an 8-page paper, missing relevant work on contamination detection and IRT applications to NLP.\n\nBeyond the major issues, Tables 3 and 4 seem redundant since they both cover post-RL comparisons and could be merged. There's also inconsistent notation switching between ℓz* and lz*, and equation numbering appears to have gaps that make some referenced equations hard to locate. I'd want to ask the authors how robust their detection is to PSN-IRT parameter quality, whether they can provide confidence intervals for those Table 1 d values given the small sample, and why they didn't test the post-RL experiment on Llama when they already had the contaminated model available.\n\nOn the scoring side, the methodology is solid and well-executed, though the small sample for d calculations and reliance on external parameters without sensitivity testing are real concerns—I'd rate soundness around 3.5/5. The minimal-information framing is genuinely novel and the post-RL robustness work is timely, but practical limitations around needing clean baselines and PSN-IRT dependence temper my excitement, also around 3.5/5. Reproducibility is decent with clear method descriptions and explicit formulas, though some QLoRA and GRPO training details are missing, so that's also 3.5/5. Overall this feels like a solid contribution that opens a new direction, though the limitations are substantial.\n\nReconsidering though—the paper packs a lot in: ten tables across seven pages with a clear narrative and well-differentiated contribution. The post-RL robustness finding is genuinely interesting and would likely generate discussion. The 4PL versus 3PL ablation is convincing, and the universal misfit observation is novel. The weaknesses are real, but some are inherent to the research direction itself, which makes them less disqualifying than they initially appear.\n\nI'm settling on 3.5 across soundness, excitement, and reproducibility, with an overall borderline conference rating. That calibrates to roughly 21% acceptance for the main track—the paper has a legitimate shot if the authors can strengthen the post-RL replication and sensitivity analysis.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26400,"cache_read_input_tokens":23674,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":26400},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d433593b-2345-4b63-8713-93a3428b10f3","uuid":"2e511f21-4b21-4491-96de-3562eeea5dbb"}
