{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KyNLkeFGGTMpkMQMVobxMf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"审稿报告已提交。\n\n**评分**: Overall 3.5 (Borderline Conference) | Soundness 3.5 | Excitement 3.5 | Reproducibility 3.5\n\n**核心判断**: 论文在 minimal-information operating point 上提出了新颖的 IRT person-fit 污染检测框架，实验覆盖全面（11 个计划实验全部呈现），post-RL 鲁棒性结果（77% 信号保留 vs HT 的 20%）是有力的差异化贡献，4PL ablation 令人信服。\n\n**主要问题**:\n1. Post-RL 核心主张仅基于单一模型（Qwen）单一污染水平（15%），作为 headline result 证据偏薄\n2. 完全依赖 PSN-IRT 外部参数却无敏感性分析——单点故障风险未量化\n3. n=3 clean seeds 计算 Cohen's d 无置信区间，精度被高估\n4. 实际部署需要 clean baseline，闭源模型无法审计，适用场景比 Introduction 暗示的更窄\n\n**升级路径**: 补充 Llama 的 post-RL 复现 + 参数扰动敏感性实验即可达到 Conference 水平。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3498,"cache_read_input_tokens":53418,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3498},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d433593b-2345-4b63-8713-93a3428b10f3","uuid":"9f3b9d5f-11d3-4b9e-99ef-9d61fed2dcfe"}
